        "scope": "passage",
        "role": "passage_overview",
        "title": "Psa 76:1-12 . On Neginoth--(See on Psa 4:1 , title). This Psalm commemorates what the preceding anticipates: God's deliverance of His people by a signal interposition of power against their enemies. The occasion was probably the events narrated in 2Ki 19:35 ; Is 37:1-28 . (Compare Psa 46:1-11 )."
      }
